      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that table is helpful. Could you expand on the cost implications? Specifically, I want to understand how the different management styles and the way they trade (intraday vs end-of-day) impact the expense ratios and any hidden administrative costs or transaction frictions investors might run into.",
      "source": "evaluator"
